\(-T/2\\\) and \\\(T/2\\\) with a peak at 1. This function undergoes a Fourier tran\sform, resulting in a sinc function \\\( \\hat{f}_0\(\\omega\) \\\) with peaks at \\\(-4\\pi/T\\\), \\\(0\\\), and \\\(4\\pi/T\\\). The convolution of \\\( f_0\(t\) \\\) with a periodic delta function \\\( \\delta_T\(t\) \\\) yields \\\( f_T\(t\) \\\), a \periodic triangular waveform. The Fourier transform of \\\( f_T\(t\) \\\) results in \\\( \\hat{f}_T\(\\omega\) \\\), which is a sampled version of \\\( 2\\pi/T \\hat{f}_0 \\\). The multiplication of \\\( \\hat{f}_0\(\\omega\) \\\) and \\\( \\delta_T\(\\o\mega\) \\\) gives the discrete spectrum of \\\( f_T \\\), represented by spikes at intervals of \\\( 2\\pi/T \\\). The Fourier coefficients \\\( c_k \\\) are defined as \\\( \\frac{1}{T} \\hat{f}_0\\left\(\\frac{2\\pi k}{T}\\right\) \\\).)/K 2/P 19434 0 R/Pg 1359 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj19627 0 obj<</K 3/P 19434 0 R/Pg 1359 0 R/S/Caption/Type/StructElem>>endobj19628 0 obj<</K 5/P 19434 0 R/Pg 1359 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj19629 0 obj<</K[6 20873 0 R 9 20874 0 R 12]/P 19434 0 R/Pg 1359 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj19630 0 obj<</K[2 20872 0 R 5]/P 19434 0 R/Pg 1363 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj19631 0 obj<</K[6 20863 0 R 9 20864 0 R 12 20865 0 R 15 20866 0 R 18 20867 0 R 21 20868 0 R 24 20869 0 R 27 20870 0 R 30 20871 0 R 33]/P 19434 0 R/Pg 1363 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj19632 0 obj<</ActualText(þÿ␀\\␀d␀i␀s␀p␀l␀a␀y␀s␀t␀y␀l␀e␀\\␀s␀u␀m␀_␀{␀k␀=␀-␀\\␀i␀n␀f␀t␀y␀}␀^␀{␀+␀\\␀i␀n␀f␀t␀y␀}␀\\␀!␀\\␀!␀\\␀m␀a␀t␀h␀o␀p␀{␀\\␀m␀a␀t␀h␀r␀m␀ ␀e␀}␀\\␀n␀o␀l␀i␀m␀i␀t␀s␀ ␀^␀{␀-␀\\␀a␀l␀p␀h␀a␀\(␀t␀+␀k␀\)␀^␀2␀}␀=␀\\␀s␀q␀r␀t␀{␀\\␀f␀r␀a␀c␀{␀\\␀p␀i␀}␀{␀\\␀a␀l␀p␀h␀a␀}␀}␀ ␀\\␀!␀\\\␀d␀i␀s␀p␀l␀a␀y␀s␀t␀y␀l␀e␀\\␀s␀u␀m␀_␀{␀k␀=␀-␀\\␀i␀n␀f␀t␀y␀}␀^␀{␀+␀\\␀i␀n␀f␀t␀y␀}␀\\␀!␀\\␀!␀\\␀m␀a␀t␀h␀o␀p␀{␀\\␀m␀a␀t␀h␀r␀m␀ ␀e␀}␀\\␀n␀o␀l␀i␀m␀i␀t␀s␀ ␀^␀{␀\\␀,␀j␀2␀\\␀p␀i␀{␀}␀k␀t␀}␀\\␀m␀a␀t␀h␀o␀p␀{␀\\␀m␀a␀t␀h␀r␀m␀ ␀e␀}␀\\␀n␀o␀l␀i␀m␀i␀t␀s␀ ␀^␀{␀-␀\\␀p␀i␀^␀2␀\k␀^␀2␀/␀\\␀a␀l␀p␀h␀a␀}␀=␀\\␀s␀q␀r␀t␀